{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e769732c09eafd5777222570e5c3aba3973c47f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f : \\mathbb{R} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> has the properties <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/5/355627bca8866cd71f42b4ecdc505196d875dc07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/6097b8285c26eda063053a590c40c048b8ea1516.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(xy)+f(x)+f(y)=x+y+xy+k\\ \\ \\ \\forall x,y \\in \\Re$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"390\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c6745cf632109cfe2dcfb2b32c769ae28c31d42f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\in \\Re$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> is a constant. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b04e029ee507be729a8be5e5017d9d7df89ba9dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840a599d31331b49ededde7f0821cdecfc641a16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } -1\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 0\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } -2\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"389\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, to determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08cc55a3a19c9f8cf005f17391db8ed355d2909c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c853882d207dda4a1b761a0bba6fb7c161831bea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0\\cdot0)+f(0)+f(0)=0+0+0\\cdot0+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"319\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee41bba4553f5f0009ad9f86388267a6606998ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle k = (-1)+(-1)+(-1) = - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"237\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now, to determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/5/265f5b79d6cb3f0af580d2b6b911516d2ae48255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle f(-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec89f09c84538ec43930ca5d8e5e0957e2000822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c566428693dbf2be12c235583109cd8ef13a1a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle f(-1\\cdot0)+f(-1)+f(0)=-1+0+0\\cdot0-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4edbf5af9312fc88e55a54e56cb3d696232abcbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle (-1)+f(-1)+(-1)=-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"214\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce4b289918f1addbf7f33ef91a6f1f4e6010e94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle f(-1)=-2\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\